## Context
The author's description (2026-11-01): Imagine can be interactive, working
towards a design note in conception/ on the standard plan (problem; situation
from git; state of the art from docs, web and forums; alternative solutions,
the most direct one and one from a different family; synthesis and
recommendation with cost estimates; phased implementation plan; double
advisor-level review plus KISS), now written as
conception/design-note-template.md. It can also be agentic, as raid's Phase 2,
whose past use the author doubts was constructive.

## Exit criteria
- [ ] A skill drives the template with the author section by section, then the double advisor review and the KISS pass
- [ ] raid Phase 2 delegates to it per ticket instead of its inline prompt
- [ ] An audit of past raid logs records what Phase 2 actually produced
- [ ] One real design note produced with the skill
- [ ] The catalog entry fits in the room made by 1416

